msgid ""
"The <em>Powered by Drupal</em> block is an optional link to the home "
"page of the Drupal project. While there is absolutely no requirement "
"that sites feature this link, it may be used to show support for "
"Drupal."
msgstr ""
"Ang block na **<em>Powered by Drupal</em>** ay isang opsyonal na link "
"papunta sa home page ng proyekto ng Drupal. Bagama’t walang ganap na "
"kinakailangan na isama ng mga site ang link na ito, maaari itong "
"gamitin upang ipakita ang pagsuporta sa Drupal."

msgid "Powered by Drupal"
msgstr "Pinatatakbo ng Drupal"

msgid "Compact mode"
msgstr "Compact mode"

