msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>You can caption images, videos, blockquotes, and so on. "
"Examples:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-caption=\"This is a caption\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-caption=\"The Drupal Dance\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;blockquote "
"data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Drupal is "
"awesome!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Hello world in "
"JavaScript.\"&gt;alert(\"Hello world!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  "
"      </ul>"
msgstr ""
"```html\n"
"<p>Maaari kang maglagay ng caption sa mga larawan, video, "
"blockquote, at iba pa. Mga halimbawa:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    "
"<li><code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-caption=\"Ito ay isang caption\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    <li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" "
"data-caption=\"Ang Drupal Dance\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"<li><code>&lt;blockquote data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Ang Drupal "
"ay sobrang galing!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"<li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Hello world sa "
"JavaScript.\"&gt;alert(\"Hello "
"world!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"```"

