msgid "Custom…"
msgstr "Pasadyang…"

msgid "Update submission"
msgstr "I-update ang pagsusumite"

msgid ""
"Enter submission data as name and value pairs as <a "
"href=\":href\">YAML</a> which will be used to prepopulate the selected "
"webform."
msgstr ""
"Ipasok ang data ng pagsusumite bilang mga pares na pangalan at halaga "
"bilang <a href=\":href\">YAML</a>, na gagamitin upang i-prepopulate "
"ang napiling webform."

